### Premium Boost Feature - API Tests
# Copy this to REST Client extension (VS Code) to test the endpoints

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminToken = your_admin_token_here

### Test 1: Get All Boosted Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/boosted
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Test 2: Boost a Product (Permanent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/21/boost
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boostExpiryDate": null
}

### Test 3: Boost a Product with Expiry Date
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/22/boost
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boostExpiryDate": "2026-12-31"
}

### Test 4: Boost Product (No Body - Uses Default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/23/boost
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Test 5: Remove Boost from Product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/21/boost
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Test 6: Get Crop Market Products (Should Show Boosted First)
GET {{baseUrl}}/marketplace/products/crop-market

### Test 7: Get Agri Shop Products (Should Show Boosted First)
GET {{baseUrl}}/marketplace/products/agri-shop

### Test 8: Get Sensor Market Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/marketplace/products/sensor-market

### Test 9: Admin Stats (Verify Total Products)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
